{
  "id": "phonics-3",
  "world": "phonics",
  "order": 3,
  "type": "phonics",
  "title": "子音組合 sh、ch、th",
  "titleEn": "sh, ch, th",
  "minutes": 10,
  "summary": "兩個字母合在一起，變成一個新的聲音。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "這一課學什麼",
      "body": [
        "有些子音兩個字母一起出現時，會變成一個新的聲音。",
        "最常見的三組是 sh、ch、th。學會它們，ship、chair、three 這些常用字就能唸對。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "三個子音組合",
      "body": [
        "先聽例字，注意開頭或結尾的聲音："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "組合",
          "聲音",
          "例字"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "sh",
            "/ʃ/ 嘴唇往前噘，送出長長的氣，像叫人「噓」安靜",
            "ship、fish、shop"
          ],
          [
            "ch",
            "/tʃ/ 舌頭先頂住再放開，比 sh 短促",
            "chair、chip、lunch"
          ],
          [
            "th",
            "/θ/ 舌尖輕放在上下牙齒之間吹氣",
            "three、thank、bath"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "th 不要唸成 s 或 f：three 不是 sree，也不是 free。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "聽聽看",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "ship",
          "zh": "船　/ʃɪp/",
          "audio": "assets/audio/phonics/ship.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "fish",
          "zh": "魚　/fɪʃ/",
          "audio": "assets/audio/phonics/fish.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "chair",
          "zh": "椅子　/tʃɛr/",
          "audio": "assets/audio/phonics/chair.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "lunch",
          "zh": "午餐　/lʌntʃ/",
          "audio": "assets/audio/phonics/lunch.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "three",
          "zh": "三　/θri/",
          "audio": "assets/audio/phonics/three.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "thank",
          "zh": "感謝　/θæŋk/",
